# The gateway has no shared-kernel or sibling references, so its build context IS this
# repository and this file needs no path adjustments. It exists to keep build output and
# local settings out of the context that travels to the daemon.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.github/

# Local settings can carry a Consul address that points at a developer's machine.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/.env
**/.env.*

**/*.db
**/*.log
**/TestResults/
**/binlog/

**/*Tests/
README.md
LICENSE